{
  "description": "DISABLED 2026-09-20 (audit finding 1). Claiming no longer creates an al_caseassignment from the browser: the queue PATCHes contact.al_claimrequest and ClaimRequestPlugin -> ClaimCasePlugin does the create server-side, which is what lets it refuse a case already taken inside one transaction. No template addresses /_api/al_caseassignments. The Contact-scoped read permission stays, because the queue still reads assignments to show what is already taken.",
  "value": "false"
